    "section": "Teams Event Companion",
    "summary": "This companion adds to the Warhammer Event Companion for Teams Events, where teams face each other and each member plays a battle against 1 member of the opposing team. It covers:\n\n- Warhammer Teams Event Mission Sequence: changes to the usual steps for generating a mission and preparing the battlefield.\n- Pairings and Rankings: how to pair players fairly and decide rankings.\n\nFor everything else, such as errata and FAQs, use the Warhammer Event Companion.",
